{"id": "aa67d279-c3cb-45cf-b65e-f69d82134f96", "name": "等価回路特性周波数算出", "description": "CPE1-T(容量要素相当)とR3(電荷移動抵抗)の並列回路部分における特性周波数(Hz)を計算します。", "inputNames": ["r3", "cpe1_t"], "outputNames": ["characteristic_frequency"], "parameters": {}, "code": "# インピーダンス評価用の特性周波数 (1 / (R * C)) の概算。CPE1-T を疑似容量 C、R3 を並列抵抗 R とする\n# 特性周波数 f_c = 1 / (2 * pi * R3 * CPE1_T)\n# pi = 3.1415926535\ncharacteristic_frequency = 1.0 / (2.0 * 3.1415926535 * r3 * cpe1_t)", "language": "python", "simulationKind": "static", "simulationConfig": {}, "stereotypes": [], "metaData": {"version": 1.0, "createdBy": null, "createdDate": "2026-06-25T12:37:11.516026", "ref": null}, "className": "ConstraintBlock"}
